      "content": "The ArchiMate Model Exchange API provides capabilities for importing, exporting, and managing ArchiMate enterprise architecture models using the Open Group ArchiMate Model Exchange File Format (AMEFF). Enables interoperability between EA tools implementing the ArchiMate 3.x standard.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: The Open Group ArchiMate Forum\n Email: archimate-forum@opengroup.org",
